text: ['Choose one —\\n• Destroy target monocolored creature.\\n• Destroy target artifact or enchantment.\\n• Draw two cards, then discard a card.', 'Deathtouch\\nFerocious — Whenever Heir of the Wilds attacks, if you control a creature with power 4 or greater, Heir of the Wilds gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Equipped creature has defender and "{2}, {T}: Other creatures you control gain trample and get +X/+X until end of turn, where X is this creature\'s power."\\nEquip {3}', 'Exile target nonland permanent.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, creatures you control gain lifelink until end of turn.', 'Haste\\nWhenever Ankle Shanker attacks, creatures you control gain first strike and deathtouch until end of turn.', "Untap each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it during each other player's untap step.", 'Whenever Avalanche Tusker attacks, target creature defending player controls blocks it this combat if able.', 'Whenever one or more cards are put into exile from your graveyard, put that many +1/+1 counters on Rakshasa Vizier.', '{T}: Add {G}, {U}, or {R}.\\nMorph {2} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Rattleclaw Mystic is turned face up, add {G}{U}{R}.']
flavor: ['"Hold the high ground, then bring it to your enemy"\\n—Surrak, khan of the Temur', '"No one petal claims beauty for the lotus."', '"Strike," the fumes hiss. "Raise an empire with your ambition."', 'Abzan soldiers march to war confident that their Houses march with them.', 'In the high caves of the Qal Sisma mountains, young hunters quest to hear the echoes of their fierce ancestors.', 'Rakshasa offer deals that sound advantageous to those who forget who they are dealing with.', 'The stature of the fighter matters less than the depth of the cut.', 'What once soared high above Tarkir is now reduced to a seat.']
